						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=2790">Agrivar</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">10/20/2001 - 2:36 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
										
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hello all my Noble Paladins.<br />
    <br />
     The following is an easy to follow guide to being a better Paladin for all to read and use.  I am not going to post suggestions on gear or anything because we all think somethings are better than others so I am going to see if I can help you better fill your role as a Paladin instead.<br />
    1 Paladins can not solo past lvl 15 period.  So we need to be grouped.  Getting a group might not be easy but dont give up everyone always gets grouped.<br />
    2 How many of us Pally's use stun and flash of light?  Not many and I must suggest using them in battle.  Stun is self explainatory during battle but flash of light drops a MOB's atk and there resistances and stacks with almost all other debuffs that is in a true casters arsenal.  Flash of light makes a great taunt for when a MOB is hitting your cleric and needs to be peeled ASAP.<br />
    3 I see alot of our pally's using 1hs weapons.  A pally should never use a 1hs weapon not even the uber ones.  for example the wurmslayer is a great WARRIOR weapon for dual weilding not for use...we usually dont have the high strength for the wurmy to be as effective in our hands.  Also all our quest that lead to our epic weapon are 2 handers except for the ghoulbane.  Get your skills up in 2hs fast so when we obtain these weapons we can hit for the max all the time.<br />
<br />
These are just suggestions and to be used as you see fit.<br />
     if you guys have any questions leave a post or send me a tell and I will gladly help you guys.<br />
<br />
Agrivar Noble Paladin Advisor						</td>
