				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hmmm hey Agrivar,your right and your wrong.If my Rogue ca solo at lvl 20 why cant my pally?Hmm i think he will.<br />
YES YOUR RIGHT ON THE 2HS cmon Pallys out there our Epic is THE FIREY AVENGER a 2hslasher.!hslashers are ok at about like lvl 20 but when you break the cap on damage you gonna want a 2hs in your hand.<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
Hope this helps,sorry Agrivar if i put you down or something<br />
<br />
Valygar Corthala lvl 11 paladin getting (lvl 20) soon Btw						</td>
