					<div class="xsmall">10/29/2001 - 9:10 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2234">Reikon Pureblade</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2289">Juliani Shadowhunter</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=1367">Dolbin</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														WOW! I had no idea about the 1hs weapons, are they all 2 handers after the Ghoulsbane? If so I need to start working it then. Can anyone recomend a decent 2hander? I will start looking for one.<br />
<br />
Reikon						</td>
