			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=2790">Agrivar</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">10/29/2001 - 9:57 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
										
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Well Val evryone plays there character differently and I also stated in my 1st post that these are my thoughts but i will explain why here.  Pally's are a mix of melee and cleric a true hybrid in nature.  pally's lvl slower than most other pure classes or even other hybrid classes ie: shamans, rangers.  Can soloing be done past 15...of course it can.  I sometimes kill blues to me in DL and ot but the Damage I take and the mana I use is way too much and down time is really annoying.  Solo if you can but grouping will get you much better XP and no downtime because if you can kill 100mobs per night in a group compared to 20 mobs soloing....you can figure the rest out I hope.<br />
<br />
Reikon I have an Enchanted Fine steel Bastardsword you can have it hace 20 dam 42 delay +7str..not the best but its your if you want it.<br />
<br />
Agrivar Noble Paladin Advisor						</td>
